# Personal project baseline. Copy to a Git repository root and adapt
# the policy blocks to its AGENTS.md. Existing allowlists and tracked
# application configuration are project-specific.
# Sources and assembly notes: active CODEX_HOME/Templates/README.md.

# Optional repository boundary
# Keep an existing project allowlist here, before the common exclusions.
# This baseline does not prescribe which source trees may be published.

# Project-root local materials
# Adjust this block when a listed directory is intentionally published.
/Docs/
/Work/
/Plans/
/Dev/
/QA/
/Review/
/Ops/
/Local/
/Backups/
/Output/
/Meetings/
/Archive/

# Local environment files
# Shared runtime profiles require explicit project exceptions below.
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.local
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
!*.example.env

# Local AI instructions and tool configuration
# This is a local-storage policy. Adapt it when instructions/settings are shared.
AGENTS.md
AGENTS.override.md
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
CODEX.md
GEMINI.md
LOCAL_DEV.md
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.codex-tmp/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.serena/
.superpowers/
.windsurf/
.worktrees/
**/docs/superpowers/
/.github/copilot-instructions.md
/.github/instructions/
.cursorignore
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules

# Personal IDE/editor configuration and generated state
# Shared project settings require adapting this policy block.
.fleet/
.history/
.idea/
.settings/
.sonarlint/
.vs/
.vscode/
.zed/
*.sln.docstates
*.sublime-workspace
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn

